# The build context of the Dockerfile: the workspace manifest and lock, the crate and the
# entry point. Everything else (git history, target/, the book, the maintainer's ai/ notes,
# CI files, server directories made by hand) stays out.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rustfmt.toml
!LICENSE-APACHE
!NOTICE
!crates/
!docker/entrypoint.sh
**/.DS_Store
